    {
      "name": "Audience Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "audience-card-author",
      "description": "A flat tinted content surface with a geometric mark and ruled action.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-audience\"><svg class=\"ds-audience-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M50 5v90M5 50h90M18 18l64 64M18 82l64-64\"/></svg><div><h3>У вас есть своё дело.</h3><p>Тексты, музыка, рисунки, исследования — и люди, которым это интересно.</p></div><a href=\"#register\">Я создаю<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-audience{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;gap:28px;padding:34px;border-radius:12px;background:#e9eddf;color:var(--ink,#20251f);font-family:var(--font-body,'Golos Text',sans-serif);max-width:600px}.ds-audience-mark{width:76px;height:76px;stroke:var(--blue,#2448e5);fill:none;stroke-width:2}.ds-audience h3{font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 16px}.ds-audience p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#4f5949;margin:0}.ds-audience a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;grid-column:2;padding:10px 0;margin-top:8px;color:var(--blue,#2448e5);font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #2448e54d}.ds-audience a svg{transition:translate 200ms}.ds-audience a:hover svg{translate:4px}.ds-audience a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-audience{grid-template-columns:48px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:25px}.ds-audience-mark{width:43px;height:43px}.ds-audience h3{font-size:20px}}"
